  << /ActualText (Lead designer for Wayfair\031s core content platform\054 driving product direction across internal tools\054 AI workflows\054 and scalable systems that power customer\055facing experiences across 250K\053 components and 200M\053 monthly traffic on Wayfair\056com and 4 global brands\056\050\nOwned the end\055to\055end redesign of a complex internal content platform used by 50\053 teams\054 driving design direction with Product and Engineering to restructure workspace architecture\054 capabilities\054 and navigation\073 increased user satisfaction by 8\0566\045 within 2 months\056\n\nReimagined and led Blocky\054 Wayfair\031s internal AI agent\054 transforming its chat\055first experience into guided AI workflows that automate complex content tasks\073 built a prototype in code using Cursor and Claude to shape product direction and align Product and Engineering\056\n\nDrove a 0\2221 template system from concept to launch\054 partnering with Marketing\054 Commercial\054 Product\054 and Engineering to define the experience and workflow\073 reduced page creation time by 83\045\054 from \1761 hour to 10 minutes\054 and reached 11\0565\045 adoption within the first month\056\n\nAccelerated product iteration and roadmap delivery using AI tools including Cursor\054 Claude Code\054 and Figma Make\054 prototyping product visions\054 contributing lightweight production\055ready UI code\054 and reducing engineering lift across design and implementation\056)
